   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h2>你可以前往商场购物，也可以换个方式</h2>\n<p>你可以轻松在家中或旅途中下单订购，然后从当地的宜家商场或我们的宜家仓库自提点取货。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>步骤如下：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>结帐时选择&ldquo;自提服务&rdquo;。</li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">查看订单确认的短信<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">或宜家</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "c4e8bda6736940b192d5582916f09442"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>宜家仓库自提点：</h3>\n<p>*注意，在仓库提货点提货时，请在签收前仔细检查您的货品。如果在产品签收后您发现产品有瑕疵需要退货，您需要前往就近的宜家线下商场进行退货（除上海静安宜家城市店），宜家仓库自提点恕无法为您提供退货服务。</p>\n<p>目前宜家有以下的仓库自提点可供您提货。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "cms-Text-"
   }
  },
  {
